{"id":"n64519-1-7","stage":3,"title":"개나리 · 连翘","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64519-1-7-1","ko":"이제 겨울도 가고 봄이 오나 봐.","zh":"冬天快要过去了，春天要来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"겨울도","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울도","audio":"/audio/5e1059a2df49ead4b115.mp3"}},{"text":"가고","meaning":"过","explanation":"가다：过；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"27","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가고","audio":"/audio/1fb46b7cd8a51290e6be.mp3"}},{"text":"봄이","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봄이","audio":"/audio/4ba55e409fa97ee9abab.mp3"}},{"text":"오나","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오나","audio":"/audio/ef95ee8ee12ea340a6ec.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"时间经过或消逝。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cd25781cdd9e1dc9e07.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64519-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 저기 담벼락에 있는 개나리도 꽃을 피웠네.","zh":"是啊。看，墙边的连翘也开花了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"담벼락에","meaning":"墙壁","explanation":"담벼락：墙壁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"담벼락","audio":"/audio/6d5f676b7fcb24ef3647.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44192","senseId":"1","lemma":"담벼락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담벼락에","audio":"/audio/b3fb644931baa2ec1f28.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"개나리도","meaning":"连翘，迎春花","explanation":"개나리：连翘，迎春花；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"개나리","audio":"/audio/301d01c0c3f97f0b7598.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64519","senseId":"1","lemma":"개나리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개나리도","audio":"/audio/18ad1d63cd09fbde3446.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃을","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃을","audio":"/audio/f2e431e87f02267d34e6.mp3"}},{"text":"피웠네.","meaning":"开","explanation":"피우다：开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"피우다","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73272","senseId":"1","lemma":"피우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피웠네","audio":"/audio/ad8da64b9bee16cbe74b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"6d5f676b7fcb24ef","term":"담벼락","zh":"墙壁","audio":"/audio/6d5f676b7fcb24ef3647.mp3","entryId":"44192","definition":"墙或壁。",